    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FLY SOUTHWEST\nJUST SAY WHEN\nFlight Schedule and Fare Summary\n(Includes select TranStar flights.)\nEffective March 18, 1986\nNow flying to Nashville!\nTEJ TARA\nCELSISTE\nWILD WEST\nSHIRT SHOP\nHÁNK\nVILIANS",
